+# Feature Specification
+
+## Overview
+| Field | Value |
+|-------|-------|
+| Feature | Target Returns Ingest |
+| Scope | Medium |
+| Story | STORY-011 |
+| Affected Components | `app/returns/`, `app/common/`, `alembic/versions/` |
+| Approach | B — Cursor-Based Incremental Poll (per analysis.md) |
+| Depends On | STORY-007 (return reason enum discovery), STORY-009 (orders table for FK linkage) |
+
+## Requirements
+
+1. Poll `GET /sellers/v1/sellers/{seller_id}/product_returns` on a configurable interval (default 10 min)
+2. Persist all `ProductReturn` records into Postgres with upsert (dedup on `id`)
+3. Track poll cursor (`last_modified` high-water mark) in a `poll_state` table; fall back to full-fetch + dedup if cursor is invalid
+4. Store `return_reason` as VARCHAR; flag unknown values with `return_reason_known = false` — never crash on unrecognized enum
+5. Soft-link to STORY-009 orders table via nullable `order_id` column (no DB-level FK constraint in v1)
+6. Support `is_archived` boolean flag for future retention; no archive cron in v1
+7. Zero production HTTP calls in tests — all external calls mocked via `respx`
+8. Read-only — no PUT/POST/DELETE calls to Target API under any circumstance
+
+## Acceptance Criteria
+
+- [ ] **AC-1** `product_returns` table created via Alembic migration with all 14 fields from `ProductReturn` schema
+- [ ] **AC-2** `poll_state` table created via Alembic migration to track cursor state per endpoint
+- [ ] **AC-3** `ingest_once()` polls Target API, upserts records, updates cursor — no duplicates on re-run
+- [ ] **AC-4** Unknown `return_reason` values stored with `return_reason_known = false`; ingest continues
+- [ ] **AC-5** Every persisted return's `order_id` is queryable against orders table (soft FK; reconciliation test)
+- [ ] **AC-6** All tests pass with zero outbound HTTP to `api.target.com`
+- [ ] **AC-7** Polling interval configurable via `RETURNS_POLL_INTERVAL_SEC` env var
+- [ ] **AC-8** `/health` endpoint reports returns poller status (healthy/stale)
+- [ ] **AC-9** Structured JSON logs emitted for each poll cycle (records_fetched, records_upserted, cursor_value, duration_ms)
+
+## Codebase Context
+| Aspect | Details |
+|--------|---------|
+| Affected files | `app/returns/{__init__,client,poll,models}.py`, `app/common/{poll,enum_handling}.py`, `alembic/versions/NNN_target_returns.py`, `tests/returns/test_*.py` |
+| Current behavior | Greenfield — no returns module exists |
+| Test coverage | N/A (new code) |
