+
+### Epic Cross-Story Checklist
+- [x] **Auth/account context:** All Target API calls require `seller_id` + OAuth2 bearer token. Auth header utility deferred to STORY-007 (staging auth spike). STORY-011 accepts `seller_id` and `token` as constructor args; shared auth module TBD in STORY-007.
+- [x] **API client patterns:** `BaseIngestClient` in `app/common/client.py` — all ingest stories import from it.
