+# Test Design — STORY-011: Target Returns Ingest
+
+## Overview
+
+| Field | Value |
+|-------|-------|
+| Story | STORY-011 |
+| Scope | Medium |
+| Coverage Target | 60% |
+| Test Framework | pytest + pytest-asyncio + respx |
+| RED State | ✅ 66 failing, 11 passing (structural checks only) |
+| Total Tests | 77 |
+
+## Test Structure
+
+```
+tests/
+├── conftest.py                        # Shared fixtures (5 sample return records)
+└── returns/
+    ├── conftest.py                    # Returns-specific response fixtures
+    ├── test_ingest.py                 # Full ingest cycle, output variance, logging, config
+    ├── test_return_reason.py          # validate_enum_value() + unknown reason ingest (AC-4)
+    ├── test_cursor.py                 # PollStateTracker + cursor lifecycle (AC-3)
+    ├── test_dedup.py                  # Upsert dedup on id PK (AC-3)
+    ├── test_order_linkage.py          # Soft FK order_id linkage (AC-5)
+    ├── test_no_production_calls.py    # Gate 2a — zero outbound HTTP (AC-6)
+    ├── test_health.py                 # /health/returns endpoint (AC-8)
+    ├── test_error_handling.py         # API degradation, circuit breaker, DB failure, recovery
+    └── test_client.py                 # TargetReturnsClient input validation, read-only guard
+```
+
+## Test Summary by File
+
+### test_ingest.py — 12 tests
+| Test | What It Verifies | AC |
+|------|------------------|----|
+| `test_full_ingest_cycle_persists_records` | Happy path: poll → parse → persist | AC-3 |
+| `test_full_ingest_cycle_rerun_produces_no_duplicates` | Dedup: re-run inserts 0 | AC-3 |
+| `test_ingest_cycle_empty_response_succeeds` | Empty API response → no crash | — |
+| `test_ingest_multiple_records_persists_all` | Bulk upsert of N records | AC-3 |
+| `test_ingest_minimal_record_uses_defaults` | Sparse record → defaults applied | Gate 3 |
+| `test_ingest_output_varies_with_input` | Output variance: 2 inputs → 2 outputs | Stub gate |
+| `test_upsert_updates_mutable_fields_on_conflict` | Upsert updates quantity on conflict | AC-3 |
+| `test_ingest_success_logs_structured_fields` | Structured JSON log emitted | AC-9 |
+| `test_ingest_failure_logs_error_with_context` | Error log with context fields | Gate 10 |
+| `test_poll_interval_defaults_to_600` | Default poll interval = 600s | AC-7 |
+| `test_poll_interval_reads_from_env_var` | Env var overrides poll interval | AC-7 |
+
+### test_return_reason.py — 10 tests
+| Test | What It Verifies | AC |
+|------|------------------|----|
+| `test_known_value_returns_true` | validate_enum_value("DAMAGED") → True | AC-4 |
+| `test_unknown_value_returns_false` | validate_enum_value("FUTURE_XYZ") → False | AC-4 |
+| `test_empty_string_value_returns_false` | Empty string → False | Gate 1 |
+| `test_known_values_set_is_not_empty` | _KNOWN_RETURN_REASONS is populated | — |
+| `test_all_known_reasons_validate_as_known` | Every known reason validates True | — |
+| `test_case_sensitivity_unknown_lowercase` | "damaged" (lower) → False | AC-4 |
+| `test_unknown_reason_stored_with_known_false` | DB row return_reason_known=False | AC-4 |
+| `test_unknown_reason_does_not_stop_ingest` | Mixed batch: all records persist | AC-4 |
+| `test_known_reason_stored_with_known_true` | DB row return_reason_known=True | AC-4 |
+| `test_null_return_reason_stored_gracefully` | None → DB NULL, no crash | Gate 1 |
+
+### test_cursor.py — 10 tests
+| Test | What It Verifies | AC |
+|------|------------------|----|
+| `test_poll_state_tracker_is_instantiable` | Constructor accepts engine arg | Gate 11 |
+| `test_get_cursor_returns_none_or_string` | First call → None | AC-3 |
+| `test_set_cursor_stores_value` | Set then get → same value | AC-3 |
+| `test_increment_error_count_does_not_reset_cursor` | Error count ++ preserves cursor | — |
+| `test_first_poll_no_cursor_fetches_all` | No cursor → full fetch | AC-3 |
+| `test_second_poll_passes_cursor_to_client` | Cursor → last_modified_since param | AC-3 |
+| `test_cursor_updated_to_max_last_modified_after_ingest` | Cursor = max(last_modified) | AC-3 |
+| `test_cursor_not_updated_on_empty_response` | Empty response → cursor unchanged | AC-3 |
+| `test_cursor_not_updated_on_api_failure` | API failure → cursor unchanged | AC-3 |
+| `test_missing_cursor_row_falls_back_to_full_fetch` | Deleted row → full fetch + dedup | AC-3 |
+
+### test_dedup.py — 6 tests
+| Test | What It Verifies | AC |
+|------|------------------|----|
+| `test_same_id_ingested_twice_produces_one_row` | PK dedup: 1 row after 2 ingests | AC-3 |
+| `test_different_ids_produce_separate_rows` | Different IDs → separate rows | AC-3 |
+| `test_upsert_updates_mutable_fields` | Conflict → update mutable cols | AC-3 |
+| `test_upsert_preserves_ingested_at` | Re-ingest → ingested_at unchanged | — |
+| `test_upsert_updates_updated_at` | Re-ingest → updated_at refreshed | — |
+| `test_bulk_ingest_with_duplicate_ids_in_same_batch` | Intra-batch dupe → 1 row | AC-3 |
+
+### test_order_linkage.py — 5 tests
+| Test | What It Verifies | AC |
+|------|------------------|----|
+| `test_return_with_valid_order_id_stored` | Non-null order_id persisted | AC-5 |
+| `test_return_with_null_order_id_stored_gracefully` | Null order_id → no crash | AC-5 |
+| `test_return_order_id_format_composite` | Composite format validated | AC-5 |
+| `test_return_with_nonexistent_order_id_stored_not_rejected` | Soft FK: no rejection | AC-5 |
+| `test_reconciliation_query_identifies_orphaned_returns` | LEFT JOIN detects drift | AC-5 |
+
+### test_no_production_calls.py — 4 tests
+| Test | What It Verifies | AC |
+|------|------------------|----|
+| `test_no_outbound_calls_to_target_api` | Zero real HTTP via respx | AC-6, Gate 2a |
+| `test_target_returns_client_is_mockable_via_di` | DI pattern works | Gate 2a |
+| `test_poll_module_client_is_patchable` | Module-level mock injection | Gate 2a |
+| `test_respx_catches_unmocked_outbound_calls` | respx safety net works | Gate 2a |
+
+### test_health.py — 5 tests
+| Test | What It Verifies | AC |
+|------|------------------|----|
+| `test_health_returns_healthy_after_recent_poll` | Recent poll → healthy | AC-8 |
+| `test_health_returns_degraded_when_stale` | Stale poll → degraded | AC-8 |
+| `test_health_returns_degraded_when_never_polled` | Never polled → degraded | AC-8 |
+| `test_health_returns_uses_configurable_interval` | Interval env var affects threshold | AC-7, AC-8 |
+| `test_health_returns_response_schema` | JSON response shape contract | AC-8 |
+
+### test_error_handling.py — 14 tests
+| Test | What It Verifies | Gate |
+|------|------------------|------|
+| `test_api_returns_429_retry_backoff` | 429 → exponential backoff | Gate 2b |
+| `test_api_returns_500_logs_and_skips` | 5xx → fail-closed, skip cycle | Gate 2b |
+| `test_api_returns_401_logs_as_warning` | 401 → warning log | Gate 2b |
+| `test_api_returns_none_response_body_handled` | None body → no crash | Gate 2b |
+| `test_api_connection_timeout_handled` | Timeout → log + skip | Gate 2b |
+| `test_api_returns_malformed_json_handled` | Bad JSON → log + skip | Gate 2b |
+| `test_oversized_response_triggers_circuit_breaker` | >10 MB → circuit breaker | — |
+| `test_circuit_breaker_threshold_configurable` | Env var threshold | — |
+| `test_db_write_failure_raises_exception` | DB down → fail-closed | Gate 9 |
+| `test_db_failure_does_not_advance_cursor` | DB fail → cursor unchanged | Gate 9 |
+| `test_api_failure_preserves_existing_data` | Failure → existing data intact | Gate 9 |
+| `test_partial_batch_failure_rolls_back_transaction` | Mid-batch fail → rollback | Gate 9 |
+| `test_api_error_logged_with_context` | Error log has context fields | Gate 10 |
+| `test_connection_error_logged_with_context` | Connection error logged | Gate 10 |
+| `test_no_bare_exception_pass` | No silent swallowing | Gate 10 |
+
+### test_client.py — 11 tests
+| Test | What It Verifies | Gate |
+|------|------------------|------|
+| `test_valid_alphanumeric_seller_id_accepted` | Normal seller_id works | Gate 4 |
+| `test_empty_seller_id_is_flagged` | Empty → rejection | Gate 4 |
+| `test_seller_id_exceeding_max_length_rejected` | >32 chars → rejection | Gate 4 |
+| `test_seller_id_with_path_traversal_rejected` | "../" → rejection | Gate 4 |
+| `test_seller_id_with_special_chars_rejected` | SQL injection chars → rejection | Gate 4 |
+| `test_client_has_no_post_method` | Read-only: no POST | Security |
+| `test_client_has_no_put_method` | Read-only: no PUT | Security |
+| `test_client_has_no_delete_method` | Read-only: no DELETE | Security |
+| `test_base_path_includes_seller_id_placeholder` | URL template correct | — |
+| `test_constructed_url_uses_seller_id` | URL construction correct | — |
+| `test_get_returns_passes_cursor_as_query_param` | Cursor → query param | AC-3 |
+
+## Acceptance Criteria Coverage
+
+| AC | Tests Covering It | Count |
+|----|-------------------|-------|
+| AC-1 | ORM model defined in `app/returns/models.py` (verified by import in all test files) | — |
+| AC-2 | PollState model defined; cursor tests verify interface | 4 |
+| AC-3 | test_ingest + test_dedup + test_cursor | 18 |
+| AC-4 | test_return_reason | 8 |
+| AC-5 | test_order_linkage | 5 |
