+| AC-7 | test_ingest (config) + test_health (config) | 3 |
+| AC-8 | test_health | 5 |
+| AC-9 | test_ingest (observability) | 2 |
+
+## Defensive Gate Coverage
+
+| Gate | Tests | Status |
+|------|-------|--------|
+| Gate 1: Null/None Boundary | `test_null_return_reason_stored_gracefully`, `test_empty_string_value_returns_false`, `test_ingest_minimal_record_uses_defaults` | ✅ |
+| Gate 2a: External API Isolation | `test_no_outbound_calls_to_target_api`, `test_target_returns_client_is_mockable_via_di`, `test_poll_module_client_is_patchable`, `test_respx_catches_unmocked_outbound_calls` | ✅ |
+| Gate 2b: API Degradation | `test_api_returns_429_retry_backoff`, `test_api_returns_500_logs_and_skips`, `test_api_returns_none_response_body_handled`, `test_api_connection_timeout_handled`, `test_api_returns_malformed_json_handled` | ✅ |
+| Gate 3: DB Constraint Alignment | `test_ingest_minimal_record_uses_defaults` (NOT NULL defaults) | ✅ |
+| Gate 4: Input Validation | `test_empty_seller_id_is_flagged`, `test_seller_id_exceeding_max_length_rejected`, `test_seller_id_with_path_traversal_rejected`, `test_seller_id_with_special_chars_rejected` | ✅ |
+| Gate 9: Failure Recovery | `test_api_failure_preserves_existing_data`, `test_partial_batch_failure_rolls_back_transaction`, `test_db_failure_does_not_advance_cursor` | ✅ |
+| Gate 10: Error Observability | `test_api_error_logged_with_context`, `test_connection_error_logged_with_context`, `test_no_bare_exception_pass` | ✅ |
+| Gate 11: Fixture Compilation | `test_poll_state_tracker_is_instantiable` (real class, not mock) | ✅ |
+
+## Output-Variance Gate
+
+| Endpoint/Method | Test | Input A | Input B |
+|-----------------|------|---------|---------|
+| `ingest_once()` | `test_ingest_output_varies_with_input` | SAMPLE_RETURN_COMPLETE (DAMAGED) | SAMPLE_RETURN_UNKNOWN_REASON (FUTURE_UNKNOWN) |
+| `ingest_once()` | `test_upsert_updates_mutable_fields_on_conflict` | quantity=1 | quantity=3 (same id) |
+
+## LLM Error-Prone Area Coverage
+
+| Category | Tests |
+|----------|-------|
+| Boundary conditions | `test_empty_string_value_returns_false`, `test_ingest_minimal_record_uses_defaults`, `test_seller_id_exceeding_max_length_rejected` |
+| Edge cases | `test_null_return_reason_stored_gracefully`, `test_return_with_null_order_id_stored_gracefully`, `test_case_sensitivity_unknown_lowercase` |
+| Off-by-one | `test_cursor_updated_to_max_last_modified_after_ingest`, `test_bulk_ingest_with_duplicate_ids_in_same_batch` |
+| Output format | `test_health_returns_response_schema`, `test_ingest_success_logs_structured_fields` |
+| Security | `test_seller_id_with_path_traversal_rejected`, `test_seller_id_with_special_chars_rejected`, `test_no_outbound_calls_to_target_api` |
+
+## Fixtures
+
+All fixtures defined in `tests/conftest.py` and `tests/returns/conftest.py`:
+- `SAMPLE_RETURN_COMPLETE` — fully populated return (DAMAGED reason)
+- `SAMPLE_RETURN_UNKNOWN_REASON` — unknown reason (FUTURE_UNKNOWN_REASON_XYZ)
+- `SAMPLE_RETURN_NO_ORDER_LINK` — null order_id
+- `SAMPLE_RETURN_MINIMAL` — only required fields
+- `SAMPLE_RETURN_NEWER_MODIFIED` — later timestamp (for cursor tests)
+- Response fixtures: single, multiple, empty, unknown_reason, minimal
+
+## Migration Verification (Gate 8)
+
+- ORM models defined: `ProductReturn`, `PollState` in `app/returns/models.py`
+- Alembic migration: deferred to Phase 8 (tables not yet created)
+- `alembic check` will be run as Phase 8 gate
+
+## Notes for Phase 8 Implementer
+
+1. **DB infrastructure needed:** Each test class needs an in-memory SQLite async engine with `product_returns` + `poll_state` tables created. Add an autouse fixture in `tests/returns/conftest.py` that patches `poll._engine` and `poll._client`.
+2. **respx for external calls:** All tests that exercise `TargetReturnsClient` must wrap in `@respx.mock` or use the DI'd mock client.
+3. **Replace `assert False` with real assertions.** Each test's docstring describes the exact Arrange/Act/Assert steps.
+4. **Structured logging capture:** Use `caplog` fixture or `logging.handlers` to capture and assert on JSON log output.
+5. **Phase 6b (security review) was not completed** due to STORY-007 blocker. Security constraints from feature-spec.md § Security Constraints are covered in these tests (read-only guard, seller_id validation, zero production calls, no PII in logs).
+
+## Follow-ups
+
+- Phase 6b security review may add additional security test requirements when STORY-007 unblocks
+- Tenant isolation tests (Gate 6) deferred — single-seller model in v1, no multi-tenant yet
+- File upload tests (Gate 7) N/A — no file upload endpoints
+- Alembic migration creation and `alembic check` gate in Phase 8
